{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104280","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104280/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104280/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104280/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104280","id":2925852804,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6O95kF","number":104280,"title":"Add `Span` equality (`==` and `!=`) operators.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-03-17T17:13:40Z","updated_at":"2025-11-17T17:37:21Z","closed_at":"2025-11-17T17:03:40Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104280","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104280","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104280.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104280.patch","merged_at":"2025-11-17T17:03:40Z"},"body":"This happens to allow us to deduplicate a bunch of `operator==` from `String` and `Vector`.\r\nIt might be possible to remove explicit overloads in those functions, instead relying on implicit conversions to `Span`, but this is a bit risky compilation wise and thus out of scope for this PR. Will revisit this in a future PR.\r\n\r\n`Span<char32_t>` comparison to `Span<char>` is somewhat questionable from a `String` perspective, because it implicitly interprets the `Span<char>` as `latin1`, although it's usually `ascii` (still correct) or utf-8 (incorrect). \r\nStill, from a `Span` perspective this is entirely reasonable, because individual elements report equality. It is up to callers to differentiate encodings if they matter.\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\n\r\nThis PR happens to optimize the equality checks of `Packed*Array` (fundamentally typed `Vector`). The reason is that the old implementation lacked a `memcmp` optimization. I naively benchmarked a ~4x improvement on my computer. The improvement is likely to be better on modern `x86_64` machines, due to wider SIMD support (up to 16x).\r\n\r\nI benchmarked this code:\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node2D\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tvar a := PackedInt32Array()\r\n\ta.resize(500000000)\r\n\tvar b := PackedInt32Array()\r\n\tb.resize(500000000)\r\n\r\n\tfor i in 20:\r\n\t\ta == b\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis resulted in:\r\n```\r\n ❯ hyperfine -m5 -iw1 \"bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64.master --path /Users/lukas/new-game-project --quit\" \"bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64 --path /Users/lukas/new-game-project --quit\"\r\nBenchmark 1: bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64.master --path /Users/lukas/new-game-project --quit\r\n  Time (mean ± σ):     11.970 s ±  0.092 s    [User: 10.632 s, System: 0.543 s]\r\n  Range (min … max):   11.856 s … 12.081 s    5 runs\r\n\r\nBenchmark 2: bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64 --path /Users/lukas/new-game-project --quit\r\n  Time (mean ± σ):      3.168 s ±  0.035 s    [User: 1.863 s, System: 0.512 s]\r\n  Range (min … max):    3.129 s …  3.221 s    5 runs\r\n\r\nSummary\r\n  bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64 --path /Users/lukas/new-game-project --quit ran\r\n    3.78 ± 0.05 times faster than bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64.master --path /Users/lukas/new-game-project --quit\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104280/reactions","total_count":14,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":12,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104280/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}